
// Definition of words
RSpace   = [\s\t]*
//RWord    = \w+
RWord    = [0-9A-Za-z_]+
RComment = \/\/[^\n]+
RAssign  = \=
RReg     = [^\n]+
RStar    = \*
RQMark   = \?

RNewLine = \n
RMorphe  = \>
// Note easy definition of
// all symbols have to be escaped
// \w Word so [A-Za-z0-9_]
// \n will be newLine
// . will be anything
// + will be match more/any




// Morphing definition
_       > Start
Start   > Expr RNewLine? Start*
Start   > RNewLine? Start*
Start   > RNewLine?
Start   > Expr

Expr    > RComment
Expr    > RWord RSpace? RAssign RSpace? RReg
Expr    > RWord RSpace? RMorphe RSpace? List
List    > MorWord RSpace? List*
List    > MorWord RSpace?

MorWord > RWord RStar
MorWord > RWord RQMark
MorWord > RWord

